// Noise Bed — Textures and Ambient — from Synth Templates card noise-bed (schema synth-template-card/0.2)
// Generated by card-to-pdl.py: card words → vocabulary.yaml numbers → VCV Fundamental knobs. Do not edit; edit the card.
# voices: 1

@AMP = VCA
@AENV = ADSR

// ── Signal flow ──
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN1    // fx skipped
AMP:OUT -> OUT:IN2

// ── Modulation ──
AENV:ENV -> AMP:CV
KEYBOARD:GATE -> AENV:GATE

// ── Parameters ──
* AMP: LEVEL = 0.8 | RESPONSE = 1.0
* AENV: A = 0.786 | D = 0.571 | S = 0.7 | R = 0.805

// ── Not carried into PDL ──
// block noise: noise source (no noise module in the registry)
// block filter1: bandpass filter (VCF has LPF and HPF outputs only)
// block fx: fx chain (reverb)
// block lfo1: random LFO (LFO has sine, triangle, saw, square outputs)
// audio ['noise', 'filter1']: edge from/to an unmapped block (noise → filter1)
// audio ['filter1', 'amp']: edge from/to an unmapped block (filter1 → amp)
// audio ['amp', 'fx']: edge through fx (no fx module; the voice goes straight out)
// route lfo1 → filter1.cutoff: route to an unmapped block (filter1)
// route wheel → lfo1.rate: route to an unmapped block (lfo1)
